  "name": "FACTOR VIII INHIBITOR ASSAY BETHISDA ASSAY",
  "code": "1547",
  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<p data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"386\">The <strong data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"125\">Bethesda assay</strong> is used to <strong data-start=\"137\" data-end=\"173\">quantify inhibitors (antibodies)</strong> against <strong data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"197\">Factor VIII</strong>, which interfere with normal clotting. This test is especially important in patients with <strong data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"304\">hemophilia A</strong> who may develop these inhibitors after receiving Factor VIII replacement therapy.</p>\n<p data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"386\">The test measures the <strong data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"461\">inhibitory strength</strong> of antibodies in the patient&rsquo;s plasma by determining how much Factor VIII activity is neutralized.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1225\"><strong data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1225\">Clinical Interpretation:</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1255\"><strong data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1255\">Negative (&lt; 0.6 BU)</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1331\">\n<li data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1281\">\n<p data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1281\">No detectable inhibitor</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1331\">\n<p data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1331\">Normal response to Factor VIII therapy expected</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1372\"><strong data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1372\">Low-Titer Inhibitor (0.6&ndash;5 BU)</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1466\">\n<li data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1423\">\n<p data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1423\">May still respond to higher doses of Factor VIII</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1466\">\n<p data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1466\">Monitoring needed as levels can increase</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1505\"><strong data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1505\">High-Titer Inhibitor (&gt;5 BU)</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1674\">\n<li data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1547\">\n<p data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1547\">Factor VIII therapy usually ineffective</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1615\">\n<p data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1615\">Requires <strong data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1576\">bypass agents</strong> (e.g., FEIBA, recombinant Factor VIIa)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1674\">\n<p data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1674\">May require <strong data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1666\">immune tolerance induction (ITI)</strong> therapy</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
